# Porsche Reunions — Project Context

## Stack
- Astro 5 (SSG, static output) + SCSS (no Tailwind)
- Sanity CMS — `galleryPhoto` schema only (GROQ queries)
- GSAP 3 + Lenis (smooth scroll, connected via `smooth-scroll.ts`)
- Netlify hosting + Cloudflare (rate limiting)

## Key Paths
- `frontend/src/components/` — Astro components with co-located `.scss`
- `frontend/src/components/sections/` — page sections (Hero, Reunions, Gallery, Quotes, Stories, LogoBlock, Footer)
- `frontend/src/components/Header/` — `Header.astro` + `header.scss`
- `frontend/src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro` — root layout (Header → main slot → Footer + SubmitModal)
- `frontend/src/styles/` — `_variables.scss`, `_mixins.scss`, `_layout.scss`, `global.scss`
- `frontend/src/scripts/` — `smooth-scroll.ts`, `cursor.ts`, `split-hover.ts`
- `docs/` — `AI_GUARDRAILS.md`, `MASTER_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md`, `AGENT_SKILLS.md`

## Conventions
- SCSS BEM-like naming (`.nav__link--submit`)
- GSAP plugins registered per-component (no central setup file)
- `smooth-scroll.ts` connects Lenis + ScrollTrigger via `gsap.ticker`
- Header is `position: fixed` (set in `_layout.scss`)
- `is-hero-out` class on `<body>` toggles when `#hero` leaves viewport (IntersectionObserver in `Header.astro`)
- `data-section` attributes on sections drive GA4 `section_view` events
- i18n: `es` (default) + `en` via `/en/` prefix; `localeBase()` utility

## Hard Constraints (from AI_GUARDRAILS)
- No auth, no APIs, no databases, no email systems
- Do not modify Sanity schemas unless explicitly requested
- Code and comments in English; commits in English
- Submissions handled externally by Storystream (do not touch)
